STAAD PLANE PORTAL FRAME
* A fixed-base portal frame: 6 m span, 4 m high, UDL on the beam and a wind load.
START JOB INFORMATION
ENGINEER DATE 19-Nov-26
END JOB INFORMATION
INPUT WIDTH 79
UNIT METER KN
JOINT COORDINATES
1 0 0 0; 2 0 4 0; 3 6 4 0; 4 6 0 0;
MEMBER INCIDENCES
1 1 2; 2 2 3; 3 3 4;
DEFINE MATERIAL START
ISOTROPIC STEEL
E 2.05e+08
POISSON 0.3
DENSITY 76.8195
ALPHA 1.2e-05
DAMP 0.03
TYPE STEEL
STRENGTH FY 250000 FU 410000 RY 1.5 RT 1.2
END DEFINE MATERIAL
MEMBER PROPERTY INDIAN
1 3 TABLE ST ISMB300
2 TABLE ST ISMB400
CONSTANTS
MATERIAL STEEL ALL
SUPPORTS
1 4 FIXED
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DEAD + LIVE
MEMBER LOAD
2 UNI GY -20
JOINT LOAD
2 FX 10
LOAD 2 LOADTYPE Wind  TITLE WIND ONLY
JOINT LOAD
2 FX 25
LOAD COMB 3 DL + WL
1 1.5 2 1.5
PERFORM ANALYSIS
PARAMETER 1
CODE IS800 LSD
FYLD 250000 ALL
CHECK CODE ALL
FINISH
